{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"736489857928396840","content":"GOOD EVENING!","created_at":"2020-07-30T00:05:53.244000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738185563839922289","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"justjack420","id":"592252026226999306","is_bot":0,"username":"justjack420"},"author_id":"592252026226999306","channel_id":"736489857928396840","content":"\"Been a busy week so far wit tha underwater city, island party, an trial an what have ye.\" Kiln glances down at her Tome. \"Say ye would happen ta be able ta help me piece some tings taget'er, would ye?\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T00:07:49.233000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738186050333179905","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"736489857928396840","content":"\"I CAN CERTAINLY TRY!\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T00:08:22.107000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738186188216729671","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"justjack420","id":"592252026226999306","is_bot":0,"username":"justjack420"},"author_id":"592252026226999306","channel_id":"736489857928396840","content":"\"Been tryin ta wrap ma head around why O would have an obelisk dedicated ta him at tha bottom o tha sea. Afflicted Navar was tellin me they found one overseein four graves near Mantapolis.\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T00:11:20.035000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738186934500851783","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"736489857928396840","content":"\"The societies of hermetic order, such as the order of Freemasons have set the corner stone of every great city. Every hermtic order has its foundations in Egypt and the earliest ones contained clerics of the old Gods such as the one who guides you now.\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T00:14:01.359000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738187611142750278","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"736489857928396840","content":"\"The order of the Rose Cross, The Order of the Freemason, The order of the Templar, The order of the Illuminati and The Arcanian Tinkers and more minor branches all still exist in the world. Each seeks in its own way to set the foundations that the Golden Dawn would see twisted to fit it's design.\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T00:16:33.290000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738188248387420181","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"justjack420","id":"592252026226999306","is_bot":0,"username":"justjack420"},"author_id":"592252026226999306","channel_id":"736489857928396840","content":"\"But why at tha bottom o tha ocean? An who were these folk that O watches o'er?\" Kiln appears frustrated as more questions flow into her mind.","created_at":"2020-07-30T00:46:23.053000Z","edited_at":"2020-07-30T03:08:17.851000Z","id":"738195755197661284","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
